#: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp
msgid ""
"Filter nodes by entering a part of their name, type (if prefixed with \"type:"
"\" or \"t:\")\n"
"or group (if prefixed with \"group:\" or \"g:\"). Filtering is case-"
"insensitive."
msgstr ""
"ກອງໂນດໂດຍການປ້ອນບາງສ່ວນຂອງຊື່, ປະເພດ (ຖ້ານຳໜ້າດ້ວຍ \"type:\" ຫຼື \"t:\")\n"
"ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ (ຖ້ານຳໜ້າດ້ວຍ \"group:\" ຫຼື \"g:\"). ການກອງບໍ່ແຍກຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ."

#: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp
msgid "Filter by Type"
msgstr "ກອງຕາມປະເພດ"

#: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp
msgid ""
"Selects all Nodes of the given type.\n"
"Inserts \"type:\". You can also use the shorthand \"t:\"."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກທຸກໂນດຕາມປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ຈະໃສ່ \"type:\". ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຫຍໍ້ \"t:\" ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp
msgid "Filter by Group"
msgstr "ກອງຕາມກຸ່ມ"

#: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp
msgid ""
"Selects all Nodes belonging to the given group.\n"
"If empty, selects any Node belonging to any group.\n"
"Inserts \"group:\". You can also use the shorthand \"g:\"."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກທຸກໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ຖ້າຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະເລືອກທຸກໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມໃດກໍໄດ້.\n"
"ຈະໃສ່ \"group:\". ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຫຍໍ້ \"g:\" ໄດ້ຄືກັນ."

#: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp
msgid ""
"Cannot attach a script: there are no languages registered.\n"
"This is probably because this editor was built with all language modules "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃສ່ສະຄຣິບໄດ້: ບໍ່ມີພາສາໃດຖືກລົງທະບຽນໄວ້.\n"
"ນີ້ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນຕົວແກ້ໄຂນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍປິດໂມດູນພາສາທັງໝົດ."

