#: editor/scene/3d/gpu_particles_collision_sdf_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"No faces detected during GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D bake.\n"
"Check whether there are visible meshes matching the bake mask within its "
"extents."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບໜ້າຜິວ (faces) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bake GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D.\n"
"ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມີເມັສ (meshes) ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ ແລະ ກົງກັບ bake mask ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດຂອງມັນຫຼືບໍ່."

#: editor/scene/3d/gpu_particles_collision_sdf_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Select path for SDF Texture"
msgstr "ເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ສຳລັບ SDF Texture"

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Can't determine a save path for lightmap images.\n"
"Save your scene and try again."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ບັນທຶກສຳລັບຮູບ lightmap ໄດ້.\n"
"ກະລຸນາບັນທຶກສາກຂອງເຈົ້າແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"No meshes with lightmapping support to bake. Make sure they contain UV2 data "
"and their Global Illumination property is set to Static."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີເມັສ (meshes) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ lightmapping ເພື່ອ bake. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນມີຂໍ້ມູນ UV2 ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"Global Illumination ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ Static."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"To import a scene with lightmapping support, set Meshes > Light Baking to "
"Static Lightmaps in the Import dock."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າສາກທີ່ຮອງຮັບ lightmapping, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ Meshes > Light Baking ເປັນ Static "
"Lightmaps ໃນ Import dock."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"To enable lightmapping support on a primitive mesh, edit the PrimitiveMesh "
"resource in the inspector and check Add UV2."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ lightmapping ໃນ primitive mesh, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"PrimitiveMesh ໃນ inspector ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ Add UV2."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"To enable lightmapping support on a CSG mesh, select the root CSG node and "
"choose CSG > Bake Mesh Instance at the top of the 3D editor viewport.\n"
"Select the generated MeshInstance3D node and choose Mesh > Unwrap UV2 for "
"Lightmap/AO at the top of the 3D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ lightmapping ໃນ CSG mesh, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ root CSG node ແລ້ວເລືອກ "
"CSG > Bake Mesh Instance ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງ 3D editor viewport.\n"
"ເລືອກ MeshInstance3D node ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວເລືອກ Mesh > Unwrap UV2 for Lightmap/AO ຢູ່ທ"
"າງເທິງຂອງ 3D editor viewport."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Failed creating lightmap images. Make sure the lightmap destination path is "
"writable."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງຮູບ lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງຂອງ lightmap ສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໄດ້."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "No editor scene root found."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບ scene root ຂອງ editor."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Lightmap data is not local to the scene."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Lightmap ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນສາກນີ້ (not local)."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Maximum texture size is too small for the lightmap images.\n"
"While this can be fixed by increasing the maximum texture size, it is "
"recommended you split the scene into more objects instead."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເທັກເຈີສູງສຸດນ້ອຍເກີນໄປສຳລັບຮູບ lightmap.\n"
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຂະໜາດເທັກເຈີສູງສຸດ, ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າ ແຍກສາກອອກເປັນຫຼາຍວັດຖຸແທນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Failed creating lightmap images. Make sure all meshes to bake have the "
"Lightmap Size Hint property set high enough, and the LightmapGI's Texel Scale "
"value is not too low."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງຮູບ lightmap ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເມັສທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະ bake ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Lightmap Size Hint "
"ສູງພໍ, ແລະ ຄ່າ Texel Scale ຂອງ LightmapGI ບໍ່ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Failed fitting a lightmap image into an atlas. This should never happen and "
"should be reported."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດວາງຮູບ lightmap ລົງໃນ atlas ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ເຫດການນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນເກີດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຄວນມີການລາຍງານບັນຫາ."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Bake Lightmaps"
msgstr "Bake Lightmaps"

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Lightmap baking is not supported on this GPU (%s)."
msgstr "ການ bake Lightmap ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ GPU ນີ້ (%s)."

#: editor/scene/3d/lightmap_gi_editor_plugin.cpp
