msgstr "Normal Buffer"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Shadow Atlas"
msgstr "Shadow Atlas"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays the shadow atlas used for positional (omni/spot) shadow mapping.\n"
"Requires a visible OmniLight3D or SpotLight3D node with shadows enabled to "
"have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ shadow atlas ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ shadow mapping ແບບກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ (omni/spot).\n"
"ຕ້ອງມີ OmniLight3D ຫຼື SpotLight3D ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ເງົາຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Directional Shadow Map"
msgstr "Directional Shadow Map"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays the shadow map used for directional shadow mapping.\n"
"Requires a visible DirectionalLight3D node with shadows enabled to have a "
"visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ shadow map ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ directional shadow mapping.\n"
"ຕ້ອງມີ DirectionalLight3D ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ເງົາຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Decal Atlas"
msgstr "Decal Atlas"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "AreaLight3D Atlas"
msgstr "AreaLight3D Atlas"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "VoxelGI Lighting"
msgstr "VoxelGI Lighting"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Requires a visible VoxelGI node that has been baked to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີ VoxelGI node ທີ່ຖືກ bake ແລ້ວເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "VoxelGI Albedo"
msgstr "VoxelGI Albedo"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "VoxelGI Emission"
msgstr "VoxelGI Emission"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "SDFGI Cascades"
msgstr "SDFGI Cascades"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Requires SDFGI to be enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SDFGI ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "SDFGI Probes"
msgstr "SDFGI Probes"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Left-click a SDFGI probe to display its occlusion information (white = not "
"occluded, red = fully occluded).\n"
"Requires SDFGI to be enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ SDFGI probe ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນການບັງ (occlusion) (ສີຂາວ = ບໍ່ຖືກບັງ, ສີແດງ = ຖືກບັງທັງ"
"ໝົດ).\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SDFGI ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Scene Luminance"
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກ (Scene Luminance)"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays the scene luminance computed from the 3D buffer. This is used for "
"Auto Exposure calculation.\n"
"Requires Auto Exposure to be enabled in CameraAttributes to have a visible "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກ 3D buffer. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຄຳນວນ Auto Exposure.\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ Auto Exposure ໃນ CameraAttributes ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "SSAO"
msgstr "SSAO"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays the screen-space ambient occlusion buffer. Requires SSAO to be "
"enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ສະແດງ SSAO buffer. ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SSAO ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "SSIL"
msgstr "SSIL"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Displays the screen-space indirect lighting buffer. Requires SSIL to be "
"enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ screen-space indirect lighting buffer. ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SSIL ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອ"
"ໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "VoxelGI/SDFGI Buffer"
msgstr "VoxelGI/SDFGI Buffer"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Requires SDFGI or VoxelGI to be enabled to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SDFGI ຫຼື VoxelGI ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Disable Mesh LOD"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ Mesh LOD"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Renders all meshes with their highest level of detail regardless of their "
"distance from the camera."
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນທຸກເມັສດ້ວຍລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດສູງສຸດ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "OmniLight3D Cluster"
msgstr "OmniLight3D Cluster"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one OmniLight3D."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ OmniLight3D ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "SpotLight3D Cluster"
msgstr "SpotLight3D Cluster"

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one SpotLight3D."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ SpotLight3D ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp
