#: editor/settings/editor_build_profile.cpp
msgid "ALSA audio driver (Linux only)."
msgstr "ໄດຣເວີສຽງ ALSA (ສຳລັບ Linux ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#: editor/settings/editor_build_profile.cpp
msgid ""
"RenderingDevice-based rendering (if disabled, the OpenGL backend is required)."
