#: modules/openxr/scene/openxr_composition_layer.cpp
msgid ""
"OpenXR composition layers must have orthonormalized transforms (ie. no scale "
"or shearing)."
msgstr ""
"OpenXR composition layers ຕ້ອງມີການແປງຄ່າແບບ orthonormalized (ເຊັ່ນ: ບໍ່ມີການປັບຂະໜາດ "
"ຫຼື ການບິດບ້ຽວ)."

#: modules/openxr/scene/openxr_composition_layer.cpp
msgid ""
"Hole punching won't work as expected unless the sort order is less than zero."
msgstr ""
"ການເຈາະຮູ (Hole punching) ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ລຳດັບການລຽງຈະນ້ອຍກວ່າສູນ."

